    "Health data isn't available on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备不支持「健康」数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart rate is off, so Flowbeat can't estimate focus. Turn it on in the Health app on your iPhone (Sharing → Apps → Flowbeat) or in Settings → Health on your watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心率权限已关闭，心流无法估计专注。请在 iPhone 的「健康」App（共享 → App → 心流）或手表的「设置 → 健康」里打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart rate, from Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心率（来自「健康」）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart rate, motion and your sessions are stored only on this Apple Watch. No account, no servers, no tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心率、动作和专注记录只保存在这块 Apple Watch 上。没有账号、没有服务器、不追踪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
