    "The score is an estimate for personal reflection. Flowbeat does not diagnose, treat or monitor any health condition.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专注指数只是一个估计，供你自己参考。心流不做任何诊断、治疗，也不监测任何健康状况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
